      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "Combining this capability with the [`CKModifyRecordsOperation.RecordSavePolicy.ifServerRecordUnchanged`](ckmodifyrecordsoperation/recordsavepolicy/ifserverrecordunchanged.md) policy of the operation object prevents your app from overwriting changes to a group of records if one or more of the records on the server has recent changes.",
